<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28339" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρασμός</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρησμός</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διδράσκω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>running away, flight,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρησμὸν βουλεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.124
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρησμῷ ἐπιχειρέειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.70
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρασμῷ κρυφαίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					360
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρασμὸν εὑρεῖν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				370
			</span></i>: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1374
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.: not freq. in Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρασμῷ χρῆσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.26.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				987.23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.57b
			</span></i>.</div>
